    LOADI r3, #6, i64 ; pc 35 — r3 arm 9 (6)
J3:                     ; (label) — join: r3 in {0..18 step 2}
    ADD r1, r2, r3, i64 ; pc 36 — root: 80 evens > 64 -> record 0 (overflow defer)
